<p>By mid-2007, Enya's total worldwide sales surpassed <strong>70 million albums</strong>.</p> 

<p>Her incredible financial success without ever touring prompted a US businessperson to coin the term <strong>"enyanomics"</strong>.</p> 

<p>In the summer of 2007, she received two major academic honors.</p> 

<p>She was awarded an honorary <strong>Doctor of Music</strong> from the National University of Ireland, Galway on June 29, followed by an honorary <strong>Doctor of Letters</strong> from the University of Ulster on July 10.</p>

<h3 id="Recent_Releases">Recent Releases</h2>

<div style="float: right; width: 279px; margin:10px 0 0 30px;">
